      "If your website is slow, unreliable, or you are not sure what you are paying for in hosting, it is worth an honest look at why. Tell CINEM at hello@cinem.tech what your website does today, what your hosting costs, and what happens when it goes down. We will scope the right build and the right level of care, from a fast marketing website to a fully managed site, and price it honestly with the running costs included."
