      "If you are ready to turn your restaurant website into a steady source of bookings and orders, CINEM can help you plan the right build, from a fast marketing website to direct online ordering and an AI chatbot that answers customers when your team is busy. Contact us at hello@cinem.tech to talk through your menu, your ordering setup, and your goals, and we will give you a clear, honest quote with no hidden extras."
