      "Ask three vendors what an AI chatbot costs and you will get three answers that look like they describe different products: one quotes $29 a month, one quotes $999 to set up, and one quotes $15,000 for a build. All three can be honest. They are pricing three different routes to the same outcome — a system that answers your customers when nobody on your team is available — and the right route depends on how much of the work you want to do yourself. This guide sets out what each route really costs in 2026, what the monthly fee actually buys, and how to tell whether a chatbot will pay for itself.",
