      "An ecommerce website has three prices, and most guides quote only one of them. There is the build — what you pay to get the store made. There is the platform — what you pay every month to keep it running. And there is the cost of every order — payment fees, apps, and fulfilment — which scales with your success and is the number that surprises owners most. This guide sets out what an online store really costs in 2026, separated honestly, so you can compare a platform store against a custom build on the total cost of ownership — year one versus year three.",
      "## The short answer",
