      "## Platform vs custom: the honest trade-off",
      "A platform store — Shopify, WooCommerce, or similar — is fast and cheap to start because the hard parts already exist: the checkout, the payment handling, the admin panel, the security. You are paying for setup and design, not for reinventing a cart. It is the right buy for a new store testing demand, for a catalogue under a few hundred products, and for any business that wants to be selling next month rather than next quarter.",
